{"model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","input":["field station equipment inventory: the solar blanket is packed for another season.","field station equipment inventory: the ranger radio has a different call sign.","field station equipment inventory: the tool chest contains unrelated drill bits.","field station equipment inventory: the dry ice order lists a separate delivery date.","field station equipment inventory: the river gauge has another inspection interval.","field station equipment inventory: the compass set is assigned to a different crew.","field station equipment inventory: the weather shelter has a separate lock code.","field station equipment inventory: the sample transport box carries another permit.","field station equipment inventory: the field laptop uses an unrelated asset tag.","field station equipment inventory: the rain gauge has a different mounting screw.","field station equipment inventory: the trail marker kit sits in a separate crate.","field station equipment inventory: the emergency map includes another evacuation route.","field station equipment inventory source record: Field station generator FS-18 has serial number GEN-8831. Generator FS-18 is stored on rack B-04 in the field station equipment shed. The spare battery assigned to generator FS-18 is labeled BAT-22. The field station inventory custodian for generator FS-18 is Imani Cole.","field station equipment inventory source note: the weather mast uses a separate calibration notebook.","field station equipment inventory source note: the satellite phone has an unrelated charging pouch.","field station equipment inventory source note: the sample freezer keeps a different temperature log."],"truncate":false}